{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="section faq">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="eyebrow center">{{ s.eyebrow | default: 'Questions' }}</div>
    <h2 class="center">{{ s.heading | default: 'Before You Order' }}</h2>
    <div style="margin-top:30px">
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <details {% if forloop.first %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary>{{ block.settings.question }}</summary>
            <p>{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <details open><summary>How long does the plumping effect last?</summary><p>The visible plump typically lasts 2–4 hours per application and can be topped up any time. With daily use, most people notice smoother, fuller-looking lips even between applications after a few weeks.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is the tingle supposed to be that strong?</summary><p>A warm, tingly sensation for the first few minutes is normal and means the circulation-boosting actives are working. It should feel spicy, not painful. Start with one layer and build up as your lips get used to it.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I wear it under or over lipstick?</summary><p>Both. Wear it alone as a glossy tint, as a base before lip liner and lipstick, or dab it over the top for extra shine and volume.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><p>You're covered by our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. If you're not happy with your results, contact us for a full refund — no need to send the tube back.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How fast is shipping?</summary><p>Orders are processed within 24–48 hours. Delivery is typically 5–9 business days, with tracking emailed to you once your order ships. Bundles ship free.</p></details>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Questions" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Before You Order" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "name": "Question",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "question", "label": "Question", "default": "Question?" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "answer", "label": "Answer", "default": "Answer." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}
